public class MutableClock extends Clock {
    private Instant instant;
    private final ZoneId zone;
    public MutableClock(Instant instant) { this.instant = instant; this.zone = ZoneOffset.UTC; }
    public synchronized void setInstant(Instant i) { this.instant = i; }
    public synchronized void plus(Duration d) { this.instant = this.instant.plus(d); }
    public synchronized Instant instant() { return instant; }
    public ZoneId getZone() { return zone; }
    public Clock withZone(ZoneId zone) { ... return Clock.fixed(instant, zone); }
}
```

Now, services use `LocalDateTime.now(clock)` — with UTC zone clock → UTC LocalDateTime. Good.

